step	3	6	The cattle gate
line	<str>Gordon and Mary have a beast taking their livestock. Gordon wants me to bring him its head. I should speak to Mary in the farmhouse.</str>
line	<str>Mary thinks I could follow the beast's tracks if I spread flour where it comes in. I should ask Gordon where it gets in.</str>
