step	4	10	Tracking down the beast
line	<str>Gordon and Mary have a beast taking their livestock. Gordon wants me to bring him its head. I should speak to Mary in the farmhouse.</str>
line	<str>Mary thinks I could follow the beast's tracks if I spread flour where it comes in. I should ask Gordon where it gets in.</str>
line	<str>Gordon told me the beast comes in through the cattle gate south of the farm. I should use a pot of flour on it.</str>
line	<col=000080>The flour shows a trail leading south to a cave by the <col=800000>Kebos Lowlands mine</col>. I should follow it and kill the <col=800000>Headless Beast</col>.</col>
